{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 30, "timestamp": 1786278154, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/zsh", "TERM": null}}
[0.013317, "o", "\u001b[1;36mFAAR · Failure-Aware Agentic Recovery for OCR-RAG\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.224781, "o", "\u001b[1;36mText-first retrieval -> quality gate -> diagnose -> recover -> answer; vision only when needed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.441355, "o", "\u001b[1;36mStep 1 · the demo corpus (committed, offline, deterministic)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.651937, "o", "\u001b[1;32m❯\u001b[0m ls -R examples/demo_corpus\r\n"]
[4.872231, "o", "artifacts\tdata\r\n\r\nexamples/demo_corpus/artifacts:\r\n"]
[4.872292, "o", "phase0\r\n\r\nexamples/demo_corpus/artifacts/phase0:\r\n"]
[4.872512, "o", "ocr_text\r\n\r\nexamples/demo_corpus/artifacts/phase0/ocr_text:\r\nclean_accesslog.txt\tclean_threshold.txt\tnoisy_threshold.txt\r\n"]
[4.872648, "o", "\r\nexamples/demo_corpus/data:\r\nphase0\r\n\r\nexamples/demo_corpus/data/phase0:\r\n"]
[4.872809, "o", "sample_manifest.csv\r\n"]
[7.479297, "o", "\u001b[1;36mStep 2 · two pages, same facts — one clean, one corrupted by OCR word noise\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.688542, "o", "\u001b[1;32m❯\u001b[0m head -n 2 examples/demo_corpus/artifacts/phase0/ocr_text/noisy_threshold.txt\r\n"]
[9.918532, "o", "===== PAGE 0 =====\r\nZ3phyr c0mpliance requires a thr3shold of 42% and m0nthly r3porting.\r\n"]
[12.538823, "o", "\u001b[1;32m❯\u001b[0m head -n 2 examples/demo_corpus/artifacts/phase0/ocr_text/clean_threshold.txt\r\n"]
[13.762996, "o", "===== PAGE 0 =====\r\nZephyr compliance requires a threshold of 42% and monthly reporting.\r\n"]
[16.377518, "o", "\u001b[1;36mStep 3 · run the real pipeline over the corpus (local-hash embeddings, mock VLM, seed 42)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.593136, "o", "\u001b[1;32m❯\u001b[0m python scripts/demo/demo_run.py\r\n"]
[19.774251, "o", "FAAR · Failure-Aware Agentic Recovery for OCR-RAG — pipeline milestones\r\n"]
[19.774275, "o", "corpus    : examples/demo_corpus\r\nengine    : local-hash embeddings · mock VLM · seed 42 · ByT5 disabled\r\npipeline  : retrieve -> quality gate -> diagnose -> recover -> answer\r\n"]
[19.788789, "o", "\r\nexample   : noisy_threshold\r\nquestion  : What percentage threshold does zephyr compliance require?\r\ngold      : 42%\r\n  retrieve  top hit  fused=0.807  bm25=1.000  dense=1.000\r\n            text     Z3phyr c0mpliance requires a thr3shold of 42% and m0nthly r3porting. Every depl0yment m…\r\n  quality   FAIL  score=0.8816  corruption=0.4737  reasons=[word_noise_alert]\r\n  diagnose  word_level  ->  policy: correct_text\r\n  recover   correct_text  status=skipped  reason=byt5_disabled_by_profile\r\n  answer    '42%'  (mode=numeric_span, support_score=9)\r\n  visual    none — no multimodal spend\r\n"]
[19.79044, "o", "\r\nexample   : clean_threshold\r\nquestion  : What percentage threshold does zephyr compliance require?\r\ngold      : 42%\r\n  retrieve  top hit  fused=0.807  bm25=1.000  dense=1.000\r\n            text     Zephyr compliance requires a threshold of 42% and monthly reporting. Every deployment m…\r\n  quality   PASS  score=0.9868  corruption=0.0526  reasons=[-]\r\n  recover   none — direct answer\r\n  answer    '42%'  (mode=numeric_span, support_score=10)\r\n  visual    none — no multimodal spend\r\n"]
[19.79171, "o", "\r\nexample   : clean_accesslog\r\nquestion  : Is the system required to log access?\r\ngold      : Yes\r\n  retrieve  top hit  fused=0.807  bm25=1.000  dense=1.000\r\n            text     Access logging is mandatory for all systems. Administrators review access logs on a mon…\r\n  quality   PASS  score=1.0000  corruption=0.0000  reasons=[-]\r\n  recover   none — direct answer\r\n  answer    'Yes'  (mode=yes_no_inference, support_score=6)\r\n  visual    none — no multimodal spend\r\n"]
[19.801469, "o", "\r\nmetrics   : per-example EM/F1 from run_profile (experiment runner)\r\n  noisy_threshold    em=1.00  f1=1.000  ndcg@5=1.000  recall@5=1.000  recovery_em_effect=equal\r\n  clean_threshold    em=1.00  f1=1.000  ndcg@5=1.000  recall@5=1.000  recovery_em_effect=equal\r\n  clean_accesslog    em=1.00  f1=1.000  ndcg@5=0.000  recall@5=0.000  recovery_em_effect=equal\r\n"]
[22.540276, "o", "\u001b[1;36mStory: retrieval lands, the quality gate flags the corrupted evidence (word_noise_alert),\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[23.761808, "o", "\u001b[1;36mthe failure is diagnosed and routed to word-level recovery, and the answer is delivered\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[24.972725, "o", "\u001b[1;36mwith measured confidence (support_score 9 vs 10 on the clean page) — zero multimodal spend.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
